  "dispositions": [
    "D667 retains Project Authority folder .caprmedio_<project name> without an ID in the folder name; having an ID does not change that naming rule.",
    "D635 currently states root Projection scope_unit reference Project//caprmedio. All seven 020\u2013026 carriers have that same root reference. Preserve Projection IDs and resolved root identity; exact successor carrier encoding is not selected by this packet and must be reconciled after the root ID and bootstrap contracts are settled.",
    "R2526 and R2688 previews here are superseded duplicates; model-contracts worker owns them. R2524 and R2640 belong to other lanes.",
    "No general non-root ID format or root folder rename invented.",
    "Predefined world is an actual Scope Unit without a Declaration, not a separate bootstrap marker; Project Scope Unit remains without a formal parent.",
    "Projection R2736 permits a Scope Unit instance reference and D635 specifies Project//caprmedio; neither requires an ID-only Projection reference. No D635 encoding change is inferred."
  ],
